            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Mandatory for: standalone Li-ion batteries >100Wh (UN3480), Li-metal batteries >2g lithium (UN3090), batteries packed WITH equipment >2.7Wh (UN3481 PI966 Section I). May be exempt: batteries INSTALLED in equipment <=100Wh cell (UN3481 Section II / SP188), Bluetooth earbuds <=20Wh (UN3481). Exempt shipments still need UN38.3 + lithium battery mark. New for 2026: UN3556 (Li-ion vehicles), UN3557 (Li-metal vehicles), UN3558 (Na-ion vehicles) replace UN3171."
          }
        },
